(From the rec.games.hack FAQ)
 o Chrhack

   ChrHack (v 2.3) is a front end for IBM pc that replaces the NetHack
   text graphics with bitmaps.  The program does not alter the NetHack
   executable in any way.

   Available at wuarchive.wustl.edu:/pub/MSDOS_UPLOADS/games/chrhac23.zip.
   For further information, contact the author, Mike Marcelais (me).

Requirements: Nethack 3.1, EGA/VGA

